    "anchor": "transports-18-00",
    "summary": "Under [Transports](vsdata:core-rule/transports), in a **unified force** a unit or model of one army can embark in, or start the battle embarked in, a **TRANSPORT** model in the other army, if it could normally embark in that **TRANSPORT**.",
